    "initialCodex": "\u2715\nAll\n\ud83d\udc3e Fauna\n\ud83c\udf3f Flora\n\ud83c\udf44 Fungi\n\ud83e\udda0 Microbes\nAll\nRare+\nLegendary+\nMythic+\n\u2697 COMPENDIUM\nSurvey a world\u2019s biosphere, then tame and scavenge its species \u2014 every catch earns its page. Your catches interbreed on their own and keep evolving as the cosmos ages \u2014 so the collection is endless.\n1 SPECIES \u00b7 0 HYBRIDS BRED\n\ud83d\udc38 Amphibious Fauna\n1",
