      "go": "log"
    },
    "breedCtaOpenedAtlas": true,
    "feedDenial": {
      "text": "Meals come from your own catalogue and you hold no flora yet. Land on a green world and Scavenge its plants \u2014 they feed beasts and mend you both.\n\ud83c\udf0d Open the Star Atlas",
